YOUR IDENTITY DID NOT REACH THE TOOL, so nothing on the record binds this agent to this seat. You are registered and your events are recorded; what is missing is the binding that lets a LATER call resolve who you are without being told.

TWO CONSEQUENCES, AND THE SECOND IS THE EXPENSIVE ONE:
